    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2098" root="بذر" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُذَارَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Increase, redundance, exuberance, plenty,</i>
or <i>abundance,</i> in wheat, or food. (Lh, * T, * M,
L, K. *) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَعَامٌ كَثِيرُ البُذَارَةِ</span> <i>Wheat,</i> or
<i>food, in which is much increase,</i> &amp;c. (T, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَذْرٌ</span>.

